00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.610 align:start position:0%
 
while there aren't too many concrete  details surrounding the master of the  mystic arts sequel thus far there is  plenty for hungry fans to speculate  about one thing is for certain  whatever Marvel decides to do with the  good doctor audiences everywhere can  expect something strange Doctor Strange  in the multiverse of madness may not  have started production yet but that's  never stopped Marvel from knowing  exactly when a movie will hit theaters  at the 2019 San Diego Comic Con Marvel  head Kevin Feige unveiled details on  phase 4 of the Marvel Cinematic Universe  including official release dates for all  of the company's major upcoming projects  in 2020 and 2021 this announcement  included a May 7th 2021 release date for  the freshly-minted Doctor Strange in the  multiverse of madness the decision to  move Doctor Strange from November to May  showcases just how popular the character  has become in the past few years while  November in the beginning of the holiday  season is certainly a traditional home  for some major films may still holds  more prestige in Hollywood circles as  the beginning of the blockbuster season  Marvel clearly has a lot of faith in  this particular sequel to put it at the  forefront of its summer 2021 slate who's  laughing now Marvel Studios turned heads  back in 2014 when they announced the  hiring of Scott Derrickson to direct the  then upcoming Doctor Strange before  helming the big-budget superhero flick  Derek's ins career consisted pretty  strictly a horror fare from The Exorcism  of Emily Rose too sinister to deliver us  from evil the director cut his teeth on  flashy films intended to pry to V goers  despite his unassuming track record  derrickson turned out to be an astute  pick with an eye for striking visuals  proving to be an essential asset to the  project Doctor Strange has a look and  feel that is unique in the Marvel  Cinematic Universe definitely blending  martial arts choreography and surreal  digital imagery that would make  inceptions Christopher Nolan blush in  December 2018 Marvel officially brought  derrickson back to help Doctor Strange  in the multiverse of madness with  derrickson back and with Benedict  Cumberbatch returning as the sorcerer  supreme the future of the series is  clearly in solid hands there may not be  an official plot synopsis for Doctor  Strange too but plenty of potential  story hints have been dropped by some  behind-the-scenes people who are in the  in an April 2016 interview with double  toasted dr. strange co-writer see Robert  Cargill stated that Marvel felt some of  the initial ideas he and Erickson had  for the first film highlighted too much  of the quote/unquote weird stuff  associated with the character to  introduce the hero they reasoned the  origin story would have to ease  audiences into his bizarre world  [Music]  miss destroy however marvel did tell the  pair to hold on to their more outlandish  ideas for potential future films in the  franchise referencing the Dark Knight's  director scott derrickson told den of  geek in 2016 what made the Dark Knight  so great was that the origin story of  Batman had been well told and then it  was time to bring in a villain where you  really got to go deep and not just the  Joker also two-face  it was a more visceral experience I'd  love to be able to do that for Doctor  Strange well on stage at the 2019 San  Diego Comic Con derrickson said quote  we're gonna make the first scary MCU  film which in addition to the  announcement of a new blade project  raises the following question just how  horrific will Marvel that their  franchises get potentially pretty grim  especially considering the fact that  derrickson has been playing with the  idea of introducing Marvel villain  nightmare the demonic ruler of The  Nightmare Realm into the MCU spooky  stuff Marvel fans got a pretty exciting  surprise during the 2019 San Diego  comic-con when it was revealed that  elizabeth Olsen Scarlet Witch would be  joining Cumberbatch and company for  Doctor Strange in the multiverse of  madness when you have a strong sorcerer  it also helps when you have a strong  Witch and The Scarlet Witch is appearing  in this movie alongside ER  seeing as there are no Avengers flicks  on the upcoming docket and the fact that  her own powers draw upon the mystic arts  it makes sense that Scarlet Witch would  join Doctor Strange in the horror tint  sequel benedict wong has also been  confirmed for Doctor Strange 2 returning  as strangest trusty sidekick the  character also coincidentally named Wong  a prolific performer on stage screen and  film has been steadily acting since the  early 1990s and has appeared in numerous  sci-fi films including sunshine moon  Prometheus and the Martian so we've got  a beloved Avenger joining forces with  the sorcerer supreme and we've got a fan  favorite supporting character lending  his talent to the big screen once more  but the looming question on everyone's  mind is what about Chua tell @ g o4 as  Mordo we still think there will be no  consequences strange no price to pay  we broke our rules just like the  post-credits scene at the end of Doctor  Strange certainly paints more dough as a  villain and sets him up to be a baddie  in future films but whether that comes  to fruition in the sequel remains to be  seen the state of the MCU as we know it  would be dramatically different if  Stephen strange had not convinced Tony  Stark that he was the key to saving the  universe for a character who had barely  been introduced a year and a half before  Avengers infinity wars release  Cumberbatch's Strange had a shockingly  important role to play in the unraveling  of the end of Marvel's infinity saga but  now that endgame has come and gone  breaking box-office records along the  way what does the future of the MCU hold  for Stephen strange earth has lost three  of its greatest defenders with the  deaths of Tony Stark and Natasha  Romanoff not to mention the time travel  induced agent of Steve Rogers Clint  Barton seems content to permanently  retire after all the chaos and Thor is  out in space with Marvel's other super  team the guardians of the galaxy good  Stephen strange step up to fill the  heroic void left in Thanos his wake only  time will tell  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stuff or coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

